'''Crazed Gross Cat''' (狂乱のキモネコ ''Kyōran no Kimo Neko'', '''Frenzy Gross Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that first appears in [[Festival Gross (Insane)|Festival Gross]], where he can be unlocked as a [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Unit]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

